  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This proposal would add a string field to the VRC Tracking Control Behavior where the user could enter arbitrary \"tag\" to identify a set of tracking control behaviors. \n\nBehaviors from across the entire avatar would be considered part of the same set if they have the same tag. Each set would have its own memory of what is \"Tracked\" and what is \"Animated\". Sets would be combined additively (where \"Animated\" counts as 1 and \"Tracked\" counts as 0) to determine the final tracking state of the avatar.\n\nThis proposed system would allow separate parts of an avatar (or even parts added by addons/prefabs) to have their own control over the tracking control state without worrying about clobbering the state of other parts.",
